WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.610
So there are, obviously,
tons of images on the Internet.

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:08.189
In the instructor notes you can find
a link to a site with a Chrome logo,

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:15.290
a picture of Sam's kittens,
the flag of Mexico, a div with

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:20.190
a background that is repeated and a div
with a background that is a gradient.

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:23.220
That is to say one color
transitions into another.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:27.540
For each of the images identify
whether they are a raster image or

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.400
a vector image.

